53|// sequential tile order. The weight is rounded to bfloat16 before the
54|// multiply, as QuantizedBlockLoader/dequantize does into Ws:
55|//   w = bfloat(float(scale) * q + float(bias))
56|// (MLX writes the odd nibble as (s/16)*(byte&0xf0)+b; that is the same
57|// float value: scaling by powers of two is exact and s*q is exact in
58|// float32 for 4-bit q, so both forms round identically.)
